{
  "$comment": [
    "Source configuration for `npm run seed`.",
    "",
    "Each entry writes data/amenities/<category>.json, except the \"towns\" entry,",
    "which writes data/towns.json (town centres for the /map page).",
    "",
    "Entries marked \"verified\": false have a source identifier that has NOT been",
    "confirmed against the live portal \u2014 if the seed reports one as failed, open",
    "the dataset on data.gov.sg and paste the ID from its URL",
    "(https://data.gov.sg/datasets/<id>/view) into \"datasetId\".",
    "",
    "kinds:",
    "  onemap-towns   - geocodes the HDB town names through OneMap's open search.",
    "  lta-datamall   - LTA DataMall REST endpoint. Needs LTA_ACCOUNT_KEY.",
    "  ckan-postal    - data.gov.sg datastore rows geocoded by postal code.",
    "  onemap-theme   - OneMap Themes API. Needs ONEMAP_EMAIL / ONEMAP_PASSWORD.",
    "  geojson-dataset- data.gov.sg dataset download (GeoJSON).",
    "  local-geojson  - a .geojson file you downloaded yourself, under data/raw/."
  ],
  "sources": [
    {
      "category": "towns",
      "kind": "onemap-towns",
      "source": "OneMap \u2014 HDB town centres",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.onemap.gov.sg/",
      "verified": true
    },
    {
      "category": "busStop",
      "kind": "lta-datamall",
      "endpoint": "https://datamall2.mytransport.sg/ltaodataservice/BusStops",
      "source": "LTA DataMall \u2014 Bus Stops",
